YOU MIGHT HAVE SEEN THAT THIS

00:00:17.414 --> 00:00:18.227
BIG EVENT.

00:00:18.261 --> 00:00:19.367
WHAT THE PRESIDENT INDICATED WAS

00:00:19.369 --> 00:00:22.472
HIS GOAL WAS TO HAVE IT BY THE

00:00:22.506 --> 00:00:23.687
END OF THE YEAR.

00:00:23.721 --> 00:00:24.385
VERY AGGRESSIVE.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.747
THE ADMINISTRATION IS BEING VERY

00:00:26.781 --> 00:00:28.832
AGGRESSIVE ON REPORTS THAT CHINA

00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:31.444
IS TRYING TO HACK INTO THESE

00:00:31.445 --> 00:00:33.393
RESEARCH EFFORTS AND STEAL THIS.

00:00:33.394 --> 00:00:35.186
THE ACTING SECRETARY WITH US

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:35.461
NOW.

00:00:35.495 --> 00:00:36.305
TODD WOLF.

00:00:36.339 --> 00:00:39.195
THANK YOU FOR TAKING THE TIME.

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:40.955
I KNOW YOU ARE LOOKING AT

00:00:40.956 --> 00:00:42.594
GETTING ON TOP OF THIS.

00:00:42.595 --> 00:00:44.489
WHAT DO WE KNOW ABOUT WHAT

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:47.062
CHINESE HACKERS MIGHT BE DOING

00:00:47.063 --> 00:00:49.054
TO TRY TO STEAL THIS?

00:00:49.055 --> 00:00:51.224
&gt;&gt; WELL, THANKS, NEIL, FOR

00:00:51.259 --> 00:00:53.362
HAVING ME ON.

00:00:53.364 --> 00:00:55.671
WHATEVER CYBERSECURITY HAS DONE

00:00:55.672 --> 00:00:58.981
THIS WEEK IS TO PUT ON AN

00:00:59.015 --> 00:01:01.013
ADVISORY, MAKING SURE THAT

00:01:01.014 --> 00:01:03.301
INDIVIDUALS, WHEN IT COMES TO

00:01:03.335 --> 00:01:05.284
COVID-19 RESEARCH UNDERSTAND

00:01:05.319 --> 00:01:07.442
THAT WE HAVE SOME BAD ACTORS.

00:01:07.476 --> 00:01:10.190
CHINA SPECIFICALLY.

00:01:10.225 --> 00:01:13.592
SOME NONTRADITIONAL ACTORS THAT

00:01:13.593 --> 00:01:15.073
ARE TARGETING OUR INTELLECTUAL

00:01:15.108 --> 00:01:19.664
PROPERTY WHEN IT COMES TO THEIR

00:01:19.699 --> 00:01:20.114
RESEARCH.

00:01:20.149 --> 00:01:21.497
TARGETING INDIVIDUALS SUCH AS

00:01:21.498 --> 00:01:22.841
OUR OWN RESEARCHERS.

00:01:22.875 --> 00:01:25.438
SO WE WANTED TO MAINTAIN SOME

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:27.018
AWARENESS ON THIS SO THAT OUR

00:01:27.052 --> 00:01:28.584
U.S. COMMUNITY-BASED RESEARCHERS

00:01:28.619 --> 00:01:30.048
COULD UNDERSTAND WHAT IS GOING

00:01:30.049 --> 00:01:30.298
ON.

00:01:30.299 --> 00:01:31.594
OUR HEALTH CARE INDUSTRY COULD

00:01:31.629 --> 00:01:33.426
UNDERSTAND WAS GOING ON.

00:01:33.427 --> 00:01:36.533
VERY SIMILAR TO WHAT WE DID BACK

00:01:36.568 --> 00:01:38.286
A COUPLE MONTHS AGO, AGAIN WITH

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:38.623
DHS.

00:01:38.657 --> 00:01:41.343
WE PUT OUT AN ALERT WITH THEIR

00:01:41.344 --> 00:01:43.329
U.K. COUNTERPARTS WHERE WE SET

00:01:43.363 --> 00:01:45.491
WE MAY HAVE MALICIOUS CYBER

00:01:45.492 --> 00:01:46.503
ACTORS AGAIN TARGETING

00:01:46.504 --> 00:01:47.948
INTERNATIONAL ORGANIZATIONS.

00:01:47.983 --> 00:01:50.663
I THINK WHAT WE HAVE SEEN, NEIL,

00:01:50.664 --> 00:01:53.202
IS THAT WE SEE MORE TARGETING

00:01:53.203 --> 00:01:54.880
OTHER HEALTH CARE INDUSTRY.

00:01:54.914 --> 00:01:56.611
SPECIFICALLY WHEN IT COMES TO

00:01:56.645 --> 00:01:56.858
CHINA.

00:01:56.892 --> 00:01:58.438
THIS ISN’T A SURPRISE.

00:01:58.472 --> 00:02:02.022
WE KNOW THAT CHINA FOR A VERY

00:02:02.056 --> 00:02:04.024
LONG TIME HAS BEEN VERY BAD

00:02:04.059 --> 00:02:05.126
ACTORS IN CYBERSPACE, SO THIS IS

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:07.598
A NEWS TO US, BUT WE NEED TO

00:02:07.599 --> 00:02:08.829
STAY ON IT.

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:11.118
WE NEED TO STAY ENGAGED WITH OUR

00:02:11.153 --> 00:02:12.362
OTHER PARTNERS TO MAKE SURE THAT

00:02:12.363 --> 00:02:14.156
OUR PRIVATE SECTOR PARTNERS IN

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:15.185
THE HEALTH CARE INDUSTRY AND

00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:19.323
OTHERS ARE AWARE OF THIS AND

00:02:19.324 --> 00:02:24.145
HAVE THEIR SHIELDS UP AS WELL.

00:02:24.179 --> 00:02:29.508
&gt;&gt; Neil: SO I TAKE IT WHAT YOU

00:02:29.542 --> 00:02:32.926
ARE SAYING IS TO ADVANCE THEIR

00:02:32.928 --> 00:02:34.121
OWN POSSIBLE REMEDY, VACCINES.

00:02:34.156 --> 00:02:36.889
ANYTHING THAT MIGHT DEAL WITH

00:02:36.923 --> 00:02:39.168
THIS AND FIND A CURE FOR THIS.

00:02:39.202 --> 00:02:39.678
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:02:39.713 --> 00:02:41.204
THAT’S EXACTLY RIGHT.

00:02:41.206 --> 00:02:42.682
I THINK WHAT THEY ARE TARGETING

00:02:42.683 --> 00:02:44.742
AGAIN IS NOT ONLY THE

00:02:44.743 --> 00:02:46.085
INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY THAT WE

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:48.332
ARE CREATING HERE.

00:02:48.333 --> 00:02:50.861
AGAIN, WE TALK ABOUT COVID-19

00:02:50.896 --> 00:02:51.928
RESEARCH, BUT AGAIN, TARGETING

00:02:51.929 --> 00:02:53.895
OUR PERSONNEL TO STEAL THAT

00:02:53.897 --> 00:02:56.151
INFORMATION SO THAT THEY CAN BE

00:02:56.152 --> 00:02:57.648
AT THE CUTTING EDGE OF THEIR

00:02:57.682 --> 00:02:59.507
RESEARCH, AND WE NEED TO MAKE

00:02:59.541 --> 00:03:00.897
SURE THAT THAT’S PROTECTIVE, AND

00:03:00.898 --> 00:03:03.928
THAT’S PART OF WHAT WE DO FROM A

00:03:03.929 --> 00:03:04.978
CYBER PERSPECTIVE AT THE

00:03:05.013 --> 00:03:05.763
DEPARTMENT OF HOMELAND SECURITY.

00:03:05.798 --> 00:03:09.002
AGAIN, WORKING WITH OUR PARTNERS

00:03:09.003 --> 00:03:11.145
AT THE FBI TO PROSECUTE WHEN

00:03:11.179 --> 00:03:12.826
APPROPRIATE.

00:03:12.828 --> 00:03:17.308
&gt;&gt; Neil: NOW, AND THE

00:03:17.342 --> 00:03:19.082
ADMINISTRATION, YOU HAVE BEEN

00:03:19.083 --> 00:03:19.984
INVOLVED IN RESTRICTING

00:03:19.985 --> 00:03:20.547
IMMIGRATION.

00:03:20.582 --> 00:03:23.816
HAS THIS ELEVATED TO THE POINT

00:03:23.851 --> 00:03:26.978
OF TARGETING CHINESE STUDENTS

00:03:27.012 --> 00:03:29.951
WHO WANT TO STUDY HERE, BE HERE?

00:03:29.985 --> 00:03:32.071
EVEN ON TWO-YEAR PLANS WHERE

00:03:32.072 --> 00:03:33.656
THEY ARE LEARNING JUST BEYOND

00:03:33.658 --> 00:03:36.404
COLLEGE MATERIAL AND STUFF, IT

00:03:36.405 --> 00:03:38.698
SEEMS TO GO A LITTLE WIDER?

00:03:38.732 --> 00:03:42.288
&gt;&gt; IT DOES, AND AGAIN, FROM A

00:03:42.289 --> 00:03:44.258
DEPARTMENT PERSPECTIVE, THERE

00:03:44.292 --> 00:03:46.344
ARE A NUMBER OF VISAS THAT

00:03:46.345 --> 00:03:48.686
CHINESE STUDENTS AND RESEARCHERS

00:03:48.687 --> 00:03:49.646
AND OTHERS UTILIZE.

00:03:49.647 --> 00:03:52.142
TAKING A LOOK AT HOW WE ADDRESS

00:03:52.143 --> 00:03:53.766
THE FRAUD THAT WE ALL NOW IS IN

00:03:53.767 --> 00:03:55.020
THAT SYSTEM.

00:03:55.054 --> 00:03:57.133
AND I THINK IT TAKES ON SPECIAL

00:03:57.168 --> 00:03:59.967
IMPORTANCE HERE AS WE COME OUT

00:04:00.002 --> 00:04:00.655
OF THIS PANDEMIC.

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:03.214
AS WE LOOK TO RESTART THE

00:04:03.248 --> 00:04:04.690
ECONOMY, MAKING SURE THAT WE

00:04:04.691 --> 00:04:05.551
HAVE JOBS AVAILABLE TO

00:04:05.552 --> 00:04:07.284
AMERICANS, TO INTEGRATE THEM

00:04:07.285 --> 00:04:08.631
BACK INTO THE WORKFORCE, SO WE

00:04:08.666 --> 00:04:11.201
ARE HAPPY TO BRING THE BEST ON

00:04:11.202 --> 00:04:12.317
THE BRIGHTEST INTO THE U.S., BUT

00:04:12.352 --> 00:04:14.557
WE NEED TO MAKE SURE THAT WE

00:04:14.592 --> 00:04:16.780
RESERVE THOSE JOBS AT LEAST

00:04:16.781 --> 00:04:18.808
INITIALLY SO THAT WE CAN HAVE

00:04:18.842 --> 00:04:19.733
U.S. WORKERS REGAIN THEIR

00:04:19.734 --> 00:04:21.311
LIVELIHOOD AND PARTICIPATE, SO

00:04:21.312 --> 00:04:22.342
THERE ARE SOME STUDENT VISAS

00:04:22.377 --> 00:04:24.993
THAT WE ARE TAKING A LOOK AT.

00:04:24.994 --> 00:04:26.466
WE KNOW THAT THERE IS FRAUD AND

00:04:26.467 --> 00:04:28.733
ABUSE IN THE PROGRAM, AND IT IS

00:04:28.735 --> 00:04:29.984
TIME THAT WE LOOK AT THAT.

00:04:29.986 --> 00:04:31.853
&gt;&gt; Neil: WHAT ABOUT CHINESE

00:04:31.855 --> 00:04:33.166
STUDENTS WHO JUST COME TO STUDY

00:04:33.167 --> 00:04:33.853
HERE?

00:04:33.886 --> 00:04:37.116
ARE YOU CRACKING DOWN ON THAT?

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:40.624
THOSE THAT ARE ALREADY HERE TO

00:04:40.658 --> 00:04:41.711
STUDY?

00:04:41.745 --> 00:04:43.850
CLASSES ARE VIRTUAL EVERYWHERE.

00:04:43.884 --> 00:04:47.433
BUT DO YOU WANT TO TAMP THIS

00:04:47.468 --> 00:04:49.143
DOWN, COME THE FALL?

00:04:49.178 --> 00:04:50.353
&gt;&gt; WELL, WE ARE CERTAINLY TAKING

00:04:50.388 --> 00:04:53.696
A LOOK AT THAT, AND THERE ARE A

00:04:53.697 --> 00:04:55.218
NUMBER OF INDIVIDUALS HERE AND

00:04:55.219 --> 00:04:56.338
OVERSEAS LOOKING TO COME IN AS

00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:57.279
WELL.

00:04:57.281 --> 00:05:00.261
AND I THINK AGAIN FROM DHS

00:05:00.263 --> 00:05:01.935
PERSPECTIVE, MAKING SURE THAT WE

00:05:01.936 --> 00:05:03.812
CAN ENSURE THAT THEY ARE COMING

00:05:03.813 --> 00:05:05.723
HERE TO THE U.S. FOR THE RIGHT

00:05:05.724 --> 00:05:07.357
REASONS, THEY ARE HERE TO STUDY.

00:05:07.358 --> 00:05:08.629
THEY ARE NOT HERE TO DO OTHER

00:05:08.631 --> 00:05:09.824
NEFARIOUS THINGS.

00:05:09.825 --> 00:05:12.144
SO WE ARE DOING THAT AGAIN IN

00:05:12.178 --> 00:05:12.887
PARTNERSHIP WITH OTHER

00:05:12.921 --> 00:05:14.405
LAW ENFORCEMENT AGENCIES INSIDE

00:05:14.406 --> 00:05:15.788
THE U.S. GOVERNMENT, AND I THINK

00:05:15.789 --> 00:05:16.934
THAT’S IMPORTANT.

00:05:16.935 --> 00:05:18.725
I WILL ALSO SAY THAT THE

00:05:18.726 --> 00:05:19.523
DEPARTMENT TOOK SOME ACTION

00:05:19.525 --> 00:05:21.405
EARLIER THIS WEEK LOOKING AT

00:05:21.406 --> 00:05:23.162
CHINESE JOURNALIST THAT ARE

00:05:23.163 --> 00:05:25.078
AGAIN COMING HERE UNDER A

00:05:25.079 --> 00:05:25.589
CERTAIN VISA.

00:05:25.591 --> 00:05:27.149
THROUGHOUT THE DURATION OF THEIR

00:05:27.184 --> 00:05:29.348
STAY, SO IN MANY CASES, THAT WAS

00:05:29.382 --> 00:05:31.306
YEARS AND YEARS AND YEARS,

00:05:31.307 --> 00:05:32.815
UTILIZING THE VISA FOR OTHER

00:05:32.849 --> 00:05:33.202
PURPOSES.

00:05:33.203 --> 00:05:35.949
PERHAPS DOING OTHER THINGS THAT

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:37.074
WERE NOT CORRECT.

00:05:37.075 --> 00:05:39.464
SO WHAT WE DID IS WE TAMP DOWN

00:05:39.498 --> 00:05:41.084
ON THAT AND SAID YOU CAN STAY

00:05:41.086 --> 00:05:43.018
HERE FOR 90 DAYS AT A TIME.

00:05:43.019 --> 00:05:44.438
YOU CAN COME BACK, GET THAT

00:05:44.439 --> 00:05:45.401
REASSESS, BUT YOU WILL HAVE TO

00:05:45.435 --> 00:05:47.653
DO AN INTERVIEW WITH DHS, AND WE

00:05:47.687 --> 00:05:49.553
ARE GOING TO ASK SOME HARD

00:05:49.554 --> 00:05:51.354
QUESTIONS, SO THIS IS AN OVERALL

00:05:51.355 --> 00:05:52.856
EFFORT TO KNOW THAT WE ARE

00:05:52.857 --> 00:05:54.212
LOOKING CLOSELY AT THESE

00:05:54.214 --> 00:05:55.668
INDIVIDUALS, NOT GIVING THEM

00:05:55.669 --> 00:05:57.168
BLANKET VISAS FOR YEARS AT A

00:05:57.169 --> 00:05:57.441
TIME.

00:05:57.442 --> 00:06:00.873
AGAIN, THAT IS TO MAKE SURE THAT

00:06:00.874 --> 00:06:00.997
WE PROTECT THE AMERICAN PEOPLE.

